{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.madoka.walk",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "外景下见，她沿着水边走",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.madoka.walk",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.madoka.walk",
    "idolId": "madoka",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "沿着这里走？",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，普通地走就好。特别是不用在意镜头……",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "说是想拍自然的样子。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "我知道了。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "小心别摔倒。",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……不用你说。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "今天挺暖和的。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……是的。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "绿色晃眼，风也很舒服。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……是吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "円香有喜欢的季节吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "谁知道呢……怎么样呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……啊，抱歉抱歉。下见的时候聊天，碍事了吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "请不用在意。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "好，円香按自己的步调走就好。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "──…………",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……看起来很舒服的样子。）",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（虽然嘴上……什么都不说。）",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（──还是没能抓住真正的円香啊。）",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "──啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯？──！！",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（糟了，円香要……摔倒了──！）",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "（伸出手）",
            "nextNodeId": "100"
          },
          {
            "label": "（抓住她的手臂）",
            "nextNodeId": "130"
          },
          {
            "label": "危险！",
            "nextNodeId": "160"
          }
        ]
      },
      "100": {
        "id": "100",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "………！",
        "nextNodeId": "101"
      },
      "101": {
        "id": "101",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊…………",
        "nextNodeId": "102"
      },
      "102": {
        "id": "102",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……没、没事吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "103"
      },
      "103": {
        "id": "103",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "只是湿了一点。凉鞋而已，没什么。",
        "nextNodeId": "104"
      },
      "104": {
        "id": "104",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "比起这个……你的鞋。",
        "nextNodeId": "105"
      },
      "105": {
        "id": "105",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶？啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "106"
      },
      "106": {
        "id": "106",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "为什么连你也湿了。",
        "nextNodeId": "107"
      },
      "107": {
        "id": "107",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，不知不觉就……",
        "nextNodeId": "108"
      },
      "108": {
        "id": "108",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嘛，晾干就没事……吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "109"
      },
      "109": {
        "id": "109",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……皮鞋是不行的吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "110"
      },
      "110": {
        "id": "110",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "没事没事……！比起这个，円香你——马上就要开拍了。",
        "nextNodeId": "111"
      },
      "111": {
        "id": "111",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我去找毛巾。",
        "nextNodeId": "112"
      },
      "112": {
        "id": "112",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "在这里稍微等一下……！",
        "nextNodeId": "113"
      },
      "113": {
        "id": "113",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "114"
      },
      "114": {
        "id": "114",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "你也去跟工作人员借双凉鞋怎么样？"
      },
      "130": {
        "id": "130",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，好险……",
        "nextNodeId": "131"
      },
      "131": {
        "id": "131",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……放开。",
        "nextNodeId": "132"
      },
      "132": {
        "id": "132",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……没受伤吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "133"
      },
      "133": {
        "id": "133",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "怎么可能有……又没摔倒。",
        "nextNodeId": "134"
      },
      "134": {
        "id": "134",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "多亏了你。",
        "nextNodeId": "135"
      },
      "135": {
        "id": "135",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……等等，円香。",
        "nextNodeId": "136"
      },
      "136": {
        "id": "136",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "慢慢走比较好。说不定还会摔，一起……",
        "nextNodeId": "137"
      },
      "137": {
        "id": "137",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "差点摔倒是我不好。不过，让你帮忙这种事──",
        "nextNodeId": "138"
      },
      "138": {
        "id": "138",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "──！",
        "nextNodeId": "139"
      },
      "139": {
        "id": "139",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哇……！！",
        "nextNodeId": "140"
      },
      "140": {
        "id": "140",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──啊，好险啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "141"
      },
      "141": {
        "id": "141",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……放开。",
        "nextNodeId": "142"
      },
      "142": {
        "id": "142",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，你站稳了我就放开。注意脚下，慢慢地……",
        "nextNodeId": "143"
      },
      "143": {
        "id": "143",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "搂腰什么的……不原谅你。",
        "nextNodeId": "144"
      },
      "144": {
        "id": "144",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我也是顺手……抱歉啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "145"
      },
      "145": {
        "id": "145",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……讨厌。不原谅。"
      },
      "160": {
        "id": "160",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "──！",
        "nextNodeId": "161"
      },
      "161": {
        "id": "161",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "没、没事吧……！？哪里痛……？来，站起来──",
        "nextNodeId": "162"
      },
      "162": {
        "id": "162",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……我自己能站起来……",
        "nextNodeId": "163"
      },
      "163": {
        "id": "163",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──咦，円香，右脚的鞋呢？",
        "nextNodeId": "164"
      },
      "164": {
        "id": "164",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……？嗯……",
        "nextNodeId": "165"
      },
      "165": {
        "id": "165",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "难道是那双白色凉鞋？──……被冲走了！到水里了！",
        "nextNodeId": "166"
      },
      "166": {
        "id": "166",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "诶……",
        "nextNodeId": "167"
      },
      "167": {
        "id": "167",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──嘿……哟……！抓到了！",
        "nextNodeId": "168"
      },
      "168": {
        "id": "168",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "谢谢，您……",
        "nextNodeId": "169"
      },
      "169": {
        "id": "169",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，太好了！这凉鞋真可爱，要好好珍惜……",
        "nextNodeId": "170"
      },
      "170": {
        "id": "170",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……是啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "171"
      },
      "171": {
        "id": "171",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "虽然不是我的。那个是跟工作人员借的。",
        "nextNodeId": "172"
      },
      "172": {
        "id": "172",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "工作人……",
        "nextNodeId": "173"
      },
      "173": {
        "id": "173",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "不过，所以……没有弄丢，太好了。",
        "nextNodeId": "174"
      },
      "174": {
        "id": "174",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……嗯！是啊！",
        "nextNodeId": "175"
      },
      "175": {
        "id": "175",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……你要在水里站到什么时候。皮鞋都湿了。裤子也是。"
      }
    }
  },
